# Posts & Interactions API Endpoints
# Use with VS Code REST Client or HTTP Client extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:48217

### 1. Authenticate User (Get JWT Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "yeasin_user",
  "password": "password123",
  "fcmToken": "fcm_token_sample_123"
}

### Store Auth Token
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Create a Text Post
# @name createPost
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello world! This is my first text post on Mini Social Feed App. 🚀"
}

### Store Post ID
@postId = {{createPost.response.body.data.id}}

### 3. Get Paginated Feed (Newest First)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Filter Feed by Username
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts?username=yeasin_user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Like / Unlike Post (Toggle)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Add Comment to Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/comment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Great post! Really proud of this implementation. 🙌"
}
